package CanvasNet {
    part def SourceLoader {
        doc /* Turns a path into facts or into pixels for the files the tool reads. Detect recognizes the format from the signature bytes, then the entries of a ZIP package (presentation or drawing), then SVG text, then the extension (a file named .scad is a model); a file named .vl.json or .vl, or a .json file whose top-level $schema property names a Vega-Lite schema (read from the first 4 KiB), is a Vega-Lite chart (never taken for an SVG; a plain Vega specification is an unsupported format); Probe reads the header facts (format, size, channels, transparency, decodability, frame count, EXIF orientation, for a PDF, PPTX, or VSDX document every page with its size, rotation, and name, for an OpenSCAD model, by parsing it, the names of its modules and functions and its include and use directives, and for a Vega-Lite chart, by parsing and measuring it, the laid-out size and its marks, data references, parameters, title, and schema version) without decoding; Load and OpenPages decode a raster at its own size, render an SVG directly at the target size, render a chosen page of a document at a resolution (opening the document once for all its pages), or draw an OpenSCAD model from a named view (iso, front, back, left, right, top, or bottom, with the azimuth and elevation replaceable, orthographic or perspective) at 800 by 800 pixels by default with variables, time, default color, and a triangle limit applied and with its include and use files read from the folder of the model and below only, or draw a Vega-Lite chart at its laid-out size or the size asked for over its own background (UTC dates, bundled fonts only, no network, and the data files of the chart read by the library from the folder of the specification and below only, with no data-folder option), applying the size policy (scale, width, height, fitting a page inside a box, rounding, the 8192-pixel limit before decoding), the EXIF orientation of a JPEG, and the background color, collecting the notes about skipped or approximated features and the warnings and echo of a model (or refusing the features when strict), and reporting the operations applied. It maps an explicit list of library exceptions (missing, unreadable, unsupported feature, corrupt data, SCAD syntax and evaluation errors, Vega-Lite specification and render errors - a local data file that is missing, outside the folder of the specification, or not valid is a vega-lite-error and a data limit is budget-exceeded - exceeded limits) to expected errors and lets every other exception propagate. The unit includes ExifOrientation (reading the orientation from a JPEG and applying it to pixels), SurfaceOperations (flatten, transparency test, and fitting an image into a box by containing or stretching it), BoxOptions (the options that load a source into a box: vector sources are rendered natively at the box), and the supporting model types SourceKind, OutputFormat, SourceInfo, SourceOptions, ScadViewOptions, ScadView, SourceDirective, ChartFacts, ChartDataReference, LoadedSource, AppliedOperation, ImageDiagnostic, and SourcePage. */

        comment sourceRef /* Source: src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Tool/Imaging/SourceLoader.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Tool/Imaging/SourceLoader.Detect.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Tool/Imaging/SourceLoader.Raster.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Tool/Imaging/SourceLoader.Svg.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Tool/Imaging/SourceLoader.Documents.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Tool/Imaging/SourceLoader.Pdf.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Tool/Imaging/SourceLoader.Pptx.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Tool/Imaging/SourceLoader.Vsdx.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Tool/Imaging/SourceLoader.Scad.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Tool/Imaging/SourceLoader.VegaLite.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Tool/Imaging/ExifOrientation.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Tool/Imaging/SurfaceOperations.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Tool/Imaging/SourceModels.cs */
        comment testRef /* Test: test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Tool.Tests/Imaging/SourceLoaderTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Tool.Tests/Imaging/SourceLoaderVectorTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Tool.Tests/Imaging/SourceLoaderScadTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Tool.Tests/Imaging/SourceLoaderVegaLiteTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Tool.Tests/Imaging/SurfaceOperationsTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Tool.Tests/Imaging/ExifOrientationTests.cs */
        comment designRef /* Design: docs/design/canvas-net-tool/imaging/source-loader.md */
        comment verificationRef /* Verification: docs/verification/canvas-net-tool/imaging/source-loader.md */
        comment reqRef /* Requirements: docs/reqstream/canvas-net-tool/imaging/source-loader.yaml */
    }
}
